<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates rose</p>
<p>at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate rose by one basis point to 3.09 percent.</p>
<p>				  November 4 fix November 1 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		   3.04 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		   3.05 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		   3.09 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		   3.21 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		   3.35 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		  3.51 pct		3.47 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
